```python
def find_Max(nums):
    left, right = (0, len(nums) - 1)
    if nums[left] < nums[right]:
        return nums[right]
    while left < right:
        mid = (left + right) // 2
        if nums[mid] > nums[right]:
            left = mid
        else:
            right = mid - 1
    return nums[left]
```

